  "description": "Last-accessed age per KV v2 secret, folded from Vault audit logs by scripts/vault-secret-aggregator.py. Aggregate counts come from Prometheus; per-secret findings come from Loki as log lines. Secret path is never a label.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;background:#fff4e5;border-left:4px solid #f5a623;color:#333;font-family:inherit;\"><b>Metadata only.</b> The Vault audit device HMACs every secret value before writing it, so no panel here can render a secret. Community-built asset, not a HashiCorp product feature. Metadata only: audit logs carry HMAC'd values, so no secret value can ever be rendered here.</div>"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Secrets nobody has ever read",
      "description": "No read event anywhere in the audit window. Only visible because the baseline inventory is joined in; a secret nobody reads emits no audit event at all.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "vault_secret_last_read_age{job=\"vault-secret-hygiene\", bucket=\"never read\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "never read"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Rotated but never read",
      "description": "A rotation job is faithfully maintaining credentials that no workload has ever consumed. Invisible to every tool that looks at the secret itself; it only shows up when you fold access history.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "vault_secret_verdict{job=\"vault-secret-hygiene\", verdict=\"rotated_but_never_read\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "pure waste"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
